### Insere uma nova marca
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/brand
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"FIAT",
    "country":"ITALY",
    "continent":"EUROPE"
}

### atualiza uma nova marca
PUT  http://localhost:8080/api/v1/brand/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"GT",
    "country":"BRAZIL",
    "continent":"AMERICA"
}

### busca uma marca pelo id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/brand/6

### busca todas as marcas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/brand?name=o

#### deleta uma marca pelo id
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/brand/6